------------+--------------+--------------------
 rw_view1   | YES          | YES
(1 row)

---END---
---START---
SELECT table_name, column_name, is_updatable
  FROM information_schema.columns
 WHERE table_name = 'rw_view1'
 ORDER BY ordinal_position;
 table_name | column_name | is_updatable 
------------+-------------+--------------
 rw_view1   | a           | YES
 rw_view1   | b           | YES
(2 rows)

---END---
